  "final_answer": "## Task Complete ✅\n\nI found a bird feeder on Amazon that matches all your requirements:\n\n### 🐦 Recommended Bird Feeder\n\n**Squirrel Buster Mini Squirrel-Proof Bird Feeder for Wild Birds** (by Brome)\n\n| Specification | Details |\n|---|---|\n| **Product Title** | Squirrel Buster Mini Squirrel-Proof Bird Feeder for Wild Birds – 4 Metal Perches, 1 lb Seed Capacity, Chew-Proof Design, Lifetime Care, Garden Green |\n| **Brand** | Brome |\n| **Price** | **$36.95** (9% off — marked \"Overall Pick\") |\n| **Rating** | ⭐ **4.6 out of 5 stars** (6,361 customer reviews) |\n| **Target Species** | **Chickadee** (small bird) — designed for perching and clinging birds |\n| **Squirrel Proof?** | ✅ Yes — Special Feature listed as \"Squirrel Proof\"; chew-proof metal design with weight-activated anti-squirrel mechanism |\n| **Material** | Metal (4 metal perches) |\n| **In Stock** | Yes (300+ bought in past month) |\n\n### 🚚 Shipping — FREE? **YES ✅**\n\n- **FREE delivery** is available — standard delivery scheduled for **Tuesday, September 22** (no purchase minimum shown)\n- **Prime members** get FREE delivery even faster — **Tomorrow, September 18**\n- \"Other sellers on Amazon\" also shows **\"New (8) from $36.95 & FREE Shipping\"**\n- Plus, the product includes **FREE 30-day refund/replacement** and **FREE Returns**\n\n### 🔗 Product URL\nhttps://www.amazon.com/Squirrel-Squirrel-proof-Perches-0-98-pound-Capacity/dp/B001FK81PU\n\n### Summary\nThis feeder is an excellent match for your criteria: it's specifically designed for small birds (chickadees, finches, nuthatches), features a proven weight-activated anti-squirrel mechanism (Brome's signature squirrel-proof design), and is available with free shipping without any membership requirement.",
